# =============================================================================
#  VFM — .dockerignore  (koristi se za apps/api i apps/web build kontekst = root)
# =============================================================================
# Build kontekst je ROOT monorepo-a, pa ovo mora biti agresivno: sve što nije
# potrebno za build ne smije ući u kontekst (brzina + sigurnost).

# --- Git / CI ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky

# --- Dependencije (pnpm ih instalira u image-u) ---
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
.pnpm-store

# --- Build artefakti ---
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
**/coverage

# --- Tajne i env (NIKOJI .env ne smije u image!) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*-service-account*.json
google-services.json
secrets/
**/secrets/

# --- Lokalni podaci ---
.data
data/
infra/postgres/data
*.sqlite
*.db

# --- Mobilna aplikacija (builda se preko EAS-a, ne u Dockeru) ---
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/.expo
apps/mobile/dist

# --- IDE / OS ---
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# --- Dokumentacija (ne treba u image) ---
docs
*.md
!README.md

# --- Testovi ---
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/test
playwright-report
test-results
